= Yao Zhang - Seminar 

\n

This seminar series provides a platform for presenting and discussing recent developments in mathematics, physics, engineering, and computational science. The seminars cover a broad range of topics, including mathematical modeling, numerical methods, scientific computing, data analysis, machine learning, and their applications to complex scientific and engineering problems. Through invited talks, research presentations, and open discussions, the seminar aims to promote the exchange of ideas, encourage interdisciplinary collaboration, and provide opportunities for researchers and students to explore new methods, emerging topics, and current research challenges.

